General Information
===================

medit is a text editor.

medit is free software, released under GNU GPL license. See the LICENSE
file in this distribution for details.

This is a fork of the original medit (also known as mooedit), whose last
release was 1.2.92 in 2017. The fork lives at:
    https://github.com/abbat/medit


Installation
============

See INSTALL file in this distribution.


Bug reports and contact
=======================

Report bugs and file feature requests in the issue tracker at
    https://github.com/abbat/medit/issues


Sources
=======

medit sources are tracked using git. To check out a copy of the repository,
install git, and do
    git clone https://github.com/abbat/medit.git
This will create a new directory named 'medit' with medit sources inside.
To update them later on, do
    git pull
in this directory.

Releases are tagged, so
    git checkout v1.3.0
gets the sources of a given release.

The original sources, up to 1.2.92, which this fork started from, are at
    https://sourceforge.net/projects/mooedit/files/medit/
